<section class="split" aria-labelledby="story-h">
  <div class="l prose" data-reveal>
    <h2 id="story-h" class="sr-only">The story</h2>
    <p class="bigtext">The pandemic hit a lot of people. For Maleek, <span class="hl">it landed on top of everything else.</span></p>
    <p>Maleek had left a corporate job and put almost all his money into starting a business. Less than a year later, and a year after a tragic loss of a family member, COVID hit the business hard. Almost every opportunity dried up, and he was stuck in a new home with rent, car payments and the everyday cost of living bearing down.</p>
    <p>That was the reality for a lot of people. Like them, he kept hoping someone would spare a thoughtful word. It never came.</p>
    <p>So he started saying those words himself, first privately, then in posts. It turns out a lot of people need them too. <strong>He decided to be that voice</strong> for anyone still looking for the words.</p>
  </div>
